{"id":"n24299-1-8","stage":5,"title":"녹지 · 绿地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24299-1-8-1","ko":"이 공간을 녹지로 만든다면서요?","zh":"听说要把这个地方改成绿地对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"공간을","meaning":"场所","explanation":"공간：场所；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공간","audio":"/audio/a664be21489449336498.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18694","senseId":"3","lemma":"공간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공간을","audio":"/audio/22300d3d74454efbab09.mp3"}},{"text":"녹지로","meaning":"绿地，草地","explanation":"녹지：绿地，草地；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"녹지","audio":"/audio/318aef45520d7fb57a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24299","senseId":"1","lemma":"녹지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"녹지로","audio":"/audio/36c76de879745d1392bf.mp3"}},{"text":"만든다면서요?","meaning":"弄成，使成为","explanation":"만들다：弄成，使成为；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的内容，连接后文的评论、确认或对照。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"12","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만든다면서요","audio":"/audio/dc0bfbfe632d7640f649.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"a664be2148944933","term":"공간","zh":"场所","audio":"/audio/a664be21489449336498.mp3","entryId":"18694","definition":"要做某事的特定地点。","pronunciation":["공간"]},{"id":"318aef45520d7fb5","term":"녹지","zh":"绿地，草地","audio":"/audio/318aef45520d7fb57a81.mp3","entryId":"24299","definition":"草木茂盛的天然林地及草地，或人们有计划地种植很多草木的地方。","pronunciation":[